    "en": "ScaryMansion Active Experience Telemetry Profile"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Version 4 actor-centered xAPI vocabulary; active predicates, directly identified experiential objects, and xAPI Prepositions for documented indirect-object relations. Historical v1 telemetry remains valid and unaltered. v4 statement templates require a stable event-id extension to disambiguate events that share active verbs."
  },
